{"title":"Limestone","slug":"Limestone","hero":{"file":"LimestoneRaw.webp","width":264,"height":300},"pageid":771,"revid":20192,"timestamp":"2025-10-19T13:01:20Z","lastEditor":"Kor4d 0999","categories":["Stone","Ores"],"infobox":{"type":"Stone","fields":[{"label":"Stone","value":"$16/stud"},{"label":"Refined","value":"$12/stud"},{"label":"Forged","value":"$16/stud"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"v1.4.0"},{"label":"Date Added","value":"10/03/2023"},{"label":"Status","value":"Obtainable"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"gallery","text":"Gallery"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p><b>Limestone</b> is one of the 6 ore-holding nodes that spawn on <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Ferwater/\">Ferwater Island</a>. It only spawns in the Oke desert.\n</p><p>Raw limestone uses the new slate texture, and the new concrete texture when forged. It has the same texture and similar color as <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Sandstone/\">sandstone</a>, albeit darker. This can cause confusion for an unexperienced player.\n</p><p>Notably, gold and rose gold have a higher chance to spawn in limestone due to less ores taking their place.\n</p><p>Requires atleast a <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Steel_Refinery/\">Metal Refinery</a> to process it.\n</p>\n<h5 id=\"the-chart-below-displays-all-possible-ores-that-spawn-within-this-node\">The chart below displays all possible ores that spawn within this node.</h5>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Picture</th>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th>Notes\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Gold1\">Gold1</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Gold/\">Gold</a></td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Rose gold\">Rose gold</span></span>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Rose_Gold/\">Rose Gold</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Ink Ore Node\">Ink Ore Node</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Inkstone/\">Ink</a></td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Lithium Oaklands\">Lithium Oaklands</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Lithium/\">Lithium</a></td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Cobalt Oaklands\">Cobalt Oaklands</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Cobalt/\">Cobalt</a></td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Palladiumraw\">Palladiumraw</span> \t<noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Palladiumraw\">Palladiumraw</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Palladium/\">Palladium</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Uraniumraw\">Uraniumraw</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Uranium/\">Uranium</a></td>\n<td>Unknown spawn chance, very rare.\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"gallery\">Gallery</h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-1\" hash=\"ca7c6ca8a0feebd3c2ef3f612aa0bd10\" data-seq-no=\"1\"><div></div><div><div><div id=\"Trock--webp\"><span data-unresolved=\"1\"><noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Tree-shaped node? Credits to @PhloxLewis2\">Tree-shaped node? Credits to @PhloxLewis2</span></noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived